      <p class="lead">David S. Jones has spent more than twenty-five years as a consultant in technology and cybersecurity and more than fifty as a believer in Christ. Trained in classical music at Northern Arizona University, he serves on the worship teams at Scottsdale Bible Church and serves in the men's group, The Forge, helping to disciple men and pointing them to Jesus. He is the author of <em>Seventy Times Seven: On the God Who Forgives Past All Counting</em> and the father of two, Austin and Izzy.</p>
